void dfs(
    List<List<Integer>> graph,
    int node,
    boolean[] visited
) {

    visited[node] = true;

    for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {

        if (!visited[neighbor]) {

            dfs(graph, neighbor, visited);
        }
    }
}

DFS(node)
   ↓
Mark node visited
   ↓
Look at neighbors
   ↓
If neighbor not visited
   ↓
DFS(neighbor)
   ↓
Go deeper
   ↓
No more neighbors?
   ↓
Backtrack